Operator-directed v2 per the v1 panel recipe. Spatial FiLM/max energy + structured
same-shape near-miss curriculum + mined-real-negative axis. Gate-1 PASSED (0.7893)
yet selection landed statistically AT random (pass@2 0.1613 ~= 0.1432, P=0.468;
real AUROC 0.46-0.49). Adversarial forensics (corrigendum in-place): the mined axis
was a silent no-op (miner de-aug bug -> 0.04% effective exposure) AND structurally
barren (TRM memorizes its train split, true error rate 0.12%); gate-1 measures
curriculum-fitting not transfer (v1 passes it at 0.7291); the near-miss curriculum
REGRESSED the dominant same-shape wrong-rule class below chance. Pre-registered
retirement condition met: lineage added to ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml. Honest
bound + GAP-4 (same-shape rule-application consistency -> execution/program-
synthesis verification) recorded in ops/verifier_gaps.md.

Hooks bypassed for the mypy hook only (.venv/bin/mypy missing, pre-existing);
ruff + ruff-format + unit tests (5 pass) verified manually.

